<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xs:schema targetNamespace="http://www.unclaimed.org/NAUPA-III"
  xmlns="http://www.unclaimed.org/NAUPA-III"
  xmlns:xs="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
  elementFormDefault="qualified">

  <!--
    CHANGE LOG
    ==========
    Original : Remittance.xsd  (NAUPA-III, version 1.0)
    Corrected: Remittance_Corrected.xsd
    Enhanced : Remittance_Corrected.xsd + ReportSummary section
    Version  : Remittance @version attribute set to fixed="1.5"
               to match the NAUPA-III 1.5 (July 2026) documentation.

    CORRECTIONS TO ORIGINAL XSD
    ===========================

    Fix 1  (line ~390) OFAC OwnerType enumeration typo:
           "Individal" corrected to "Individual".

    Fix 5  (line ~1001) Cryptocurrency section heading comment:
           "Elememt" corrected to "Element".

    ENHANCEMENTS
    ============

    NEW 1  (after Property/Adjustment elements in Report) ReportSummary:
           Added optional ReportSummary element within each Report to
           provide aggregate statistics on the report's contents.

           Fields included in ReportSummary:
           - PropertyCount: Total count of Property elements
           - CashReportedAmountTotal: Sum of Cash/ReportedAmount
           - CashRemittedAmountTotal: Sum of Cash/RemittedAmount
           - SecurityReportedSharesTotal: Sum of Security/ReportedShares
           - SecurityRemittedSharesTotal: Sum of Security/RemittedShares
           - CryptocurrencyReportedUnitsTotal: Sum of Cryptocurrency/ReportedUnits
           - CryptocurrencyRemittedUnitsTotal: Sum of Cryptocurrency/RemittedUnits

           All fields are optional (minOccurs="0") except PropertyCount,
           allowing reports with no cash, securities, or cryptocurrencies
           to omit zero-valued totals while still reporting the property count.

    NEW 2  (Cryptocurrency, Section 4.4.3.2.14.2) CryptoCostBasis:
           Added optional CryptoCostBasis element within Cryptocurrency,
           modeled on the Security CostBasis element. Placed at the end
           of the Cryptocurrency sequence (after Exchange).

           Fields:
           - Name        (CryptocurrencyNameType,  maxLength 16)
           - Symbol      (CryptocurrencySymbolType, maxLength 7)
           - Amount      (CurrencyType,             decimal 12,2)
           - Units       (CryptocurrencyUnits,      decimal 33,18)
           - PurchaseDate (xs:date)

           Name/Symbol use two new named simpleTypes,
           CryptocurrencyNameType (16) and CryptocurrencySymbolType (7),
           added in Section 6.1. The main Cryptocurrency element's
           Name/Symbol (previously inline anonymous types with the same
           16/7 limits) were refactored to reference these named types,
           giving a single source of truth. This refactor does not change
           validation behavior or the XML structure.
           Database tables were intentionally NOT updated for this change.


    CHANGE #1 (Property TypeCode, Section 4.4.3.2.1) Reverted to NAUPA II
             four-character property type codes. The prior five-character
             codes (AC001..VC003) were replaced with the four-character
             code set from the NAUPA Standard Electronic File Format
             (Property Type Codes appendix, rev. 1/29/25): 123 codes
             across AC, CK, CS, CT, HS, IN, IR, MI, MS, SC, SD, TR, UT,
             and the ZZZZ catch-all. The field definition remains
             maxLength=5 for future expansion.

    CHANGE #3 — Removed the non-standard GER country code; DEU (the correct ISO 3166-1 
	        alpha-3 for Germany) remains.

    CHANGE #4 — Converted all 224 enumeration values that had trailing XML comment
	        descriptions into proper <xs:annotation> <xs:documentation>
		    blocks, so the descriptions are now visible to schema-aware tooling, 
			not just readers of the raw file.

    CHANGE #5 — Extracted the Property TypeCode enumeration into a new named type, 
	        PropertyTypeCodeType, defined once in a new "Section 7.3.3" alongside 
			StateCodeType and CountryCodeType. The Property/TypeCode element now 
			just references it (type="PropertyTypeCodeType"), consistent with
			how the rest of the schema handles reusable code lists.
		
    CHANGE #6 — Loosened the NAICSCode pattern from [1-9][1-9][0-9]{0,4} to [1-9][0-9]{1,5}, 
	        so it no longer silently rejects a valid code with a second digit of 0.
			
	CHANGE #8 — Fixed the leftover style inconsistencies: type ="IndicatorType" → type="IndicatorType" 
	        (2 spots), and <xs:complexType > <xs:complexType>	(3 spots).

	CHANGE #9 — Tightened 19 redundant maxLength facets down to the actual longest enumerated 
	        value in each case (e.g., Owner/TypeCode went from 15 → 3, RelationshipCode from 50 → 2). 
			Left PropertyTypeCodeType's maxLength="5" untouched, since that's intentional headroom 
			for future 5-character codes, not redundancy.

    CHANGE #10 — Normalized the 5 stray curly apostrophes (’) in property descriptions to 
	        straight ones ('), matching the rest of the file.

	CHANGE #11 — IndicatorType reverted from boolean "True"/"False" (change A1 below)
	        to enumerated { "X", "" }, where "X" means true and empty string means
	        false. maxLength=1, minLength removed. Affects all indicator fields
	        (NonProductionReport, NonRemitIndicator, Taxable, HIPAAIndicator,
	        Spouse, IfPaid, ReportNotRemit, ContactHolderBeforePaying). This
	        supersedes A1 below.
			

				ALIGNMENT WITH NAUPA-III 1.5 (July 2026)
				=========================================
				Applied per gap analysis (NAUPA-III_1.4_Gap_Analysis.md):

				A1 IndicatorType: changed from single value "X" to boolean
				"True"/"False" (string minLength 4, maxLength 5). Affects all
				indicator fields (NonProductionReport, NonRemitIndicator,
				Taxable, HIPAAIndicator, Spouse, IfPaid, ReportNotRemit,
				ContactHolderBeforePaying).

				A2 Owner TypeCode: values changed from Aggregate/Unknown/NamedOwner
				to AGG (Aggregate Property), UNK (Unknown), IND (Individual),
				BUS (Non-Individual). BUS is new in 1.5.

				A3 Owner element ordering: DriversLicense moved to follow
				RelationshipCode (was after Identity) to match 1.5 sequence.

				A5 Added elements defined in 1.5:
				- SoftwareInformation/Jurisdiction (StateCodeType, optional)
				- Beneficiary/IfPaid (IndicatorType, mandatory)
				- Cryptocurrency/Blockchain (string 1..30, optional)
				- Cryptocurrency/ContractAddress (string 1..100, optional;
				  element name has no space per XML naming rules)
				- MineralInterests/CountyCode (string 0..5, optional)
				- MineralInterests/PropertyDescription (string 0..250, optional)
				- MineralInterests/LegalDescription (string 0..500, optional)

				A7 Enumeration additions:
				- Report TypeCode: "Illicit Property"
				- Beneficiary TypeCode: "Representative" (Texas only)
				- Inventory ItemCode: "Knives", "Watches"

				A9 Cardinality aligned to NAUPA-III 1.5 (documentation):
				- Cryptocurrency/StateAddressNumber -> mandatory, repeating
				  (minOccurs=1, maxOccurs=unbounded; string 1..70).
				- ReturnedByPostOffice/ReturnCount -> mandatory, integer 0-99
				  (xs:nonNegativeInteger, minInclusive 0, maxInclusive 99;
				  was optional xs:short).

				REMOVALS
				========

				REMOVE 1 (Cryptocurrency) ProceedsReported and ProceedsRemitted:
				Both elements have been removed from the Cryptocurrency
				element. They are no longer part of the standard.
				Corresponding DB columns ProceedsReported and
				ProceedsRemitted must be dropped from any Cryptocurrency
				table (they were not present in the originally generated
				DB schema, so no DB migration is required unless they
				were added manually).
				-->

  <!-- Section 4 Remittance Element -->
  <xs:element name="Remittance">
    <xs:complexType>
      <xs:sequence>
        <!-- Section 4.1 SoftwareInformation Element -->
        <xs:element name="SoftwareInformation">
          <xs:complexType>
            <xs:sequence>
              <xs:element name="Version">
                <xs:simpleType>
                  <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                    <xs:minLength value="1" />
                    <xs:maxLength value="50" />
                  </xs:restriction>
                </xs:simpleType>
              </xs:element>
              <xs:element name="Contact" type="ContactType" />
              <!-- Jurisdiction the report was created for (Section 7.3.2 StateCodeType) -->
              <xs:element name="Jurisdiction" type="StateCodeType" minOccurs="0" />
            </xs:sequence>
          </xs:complexType>
        </xs:element> <!-- SoftwareInformation -->
        <!-- Section 4.2 Payment Element -->
        <xs:element name="Payment" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="1">
          <xs:complexType>
            <xs:sequence>
              <!-- Section 4.2.1 Payment TypeCode Element Values -->
              <xs:element name="TypeCode" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                <xs:simpleType>
                  <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                    <xs:maxLength value="11" />
                    <xs:enumeration value="Online" />
                    <xs:enumeration value="Check" />
                    <xs:enumeration value="Wire" />
                    <xs:enumeration value="ACH Credit" />
                    <xs:enumeration value="ACH Debit" />
                    <xs:enumeration value="InterAgency" />
                    <xs:enumeration value="ECheck" />
                    <xs:enumeration value="Other" />
                    <xs:enumeration value="None" />
                  </xs:restriction>
                </xs:simpleType>
              </xs:element>
              <xs:element name="ConfirmationNumber">
                <xs:simpleType>
                  <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                    <xs:minLength value="1" />
                    <xs:maxLength value="50"/>
                  </xs:restriction>
                </xs:simpleType>
              </xs:element>
            </xs:sequence>
          </xs:complexType>
        </xs:element> <!-- Payment -->
        <!-- Section 4.3 Remitter Element -->
        <xs:element name="Remitter">
          <xs:complexType>
            <xs:sequence>
              <xs:element name="CompanyName" type="CompanyNameType" />
              <xs:choice>
                <xs:element name="USCompanyInfo" type="USCompanyInfoType" />
                <xs:element name="ForeignCompanyInfo" type="ForeignCompanyInfoType" />
              </xs:choice>
              <xs:element name="TelephoneNumber" type="TelephoneNumberType" />
              <xs:element name="EMailAddress" type="EMailAddressType" />
            </xs:sequence>
          </xs:complexType>
        </xs:element> <!-- Remitter -->
        <!-- Section 4.4 Holder Element -->
        <xs:element name="Holder" maxOccurs="unbounded">
          <xs:complexType>
            <xs:sequence>
              <xs:element name="CompanyName" type="CompanyNameType" />
              <xs:choice>
                <xs:element name="USCompanyInfo" type="USCompanyInfoType" />
                <xs:element name="ForeignCompanyInfo" type="ForeignCompanyInfoType" />
              </xs:choice>
              <!-- Section 4.4.1 ParentCompany Element -->
              <xs:element name="ParentCompany" minOccurs="0">
                <xs:complexType>
                  <xs:sequence>
                    <xs:element name="CompanyName" type="CompanyNameType" />
                    <xs:choice>
                      <xs:element name="FEIN" type="FEINType" />
                      <xs:element name="ForeignTaxID" type="ForeignTaxIDType" />
                    </xs:choice>
                  </xs:sequence>
                </xs:complexType>
              </xs:element>
              <xs:element name="Contact" type="ContactType" maxOccurs="unbounded" />
              <xs:element name="NAICSCode">
                <xs:simpleType>
                  <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                    <xs:pattern value="[1-9][0-9]{1,5}" />
                  </xs:restriction>
                </xs:simpleType>
              </xs:element>
              <xs:element name="TaxIDExtension" minOccurs="0">
                <xs:simpleType>
                  <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                    <xs:pattern value="[0-9]{4}" />
                  </xs:restriction>
                </xs:simpleType>
              </xs:element>
              <xs:element name="DBAName" type="CompanyNameType" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"/>
              <!-- Section 4.4.2 Incorporated Element -->
              <xs:element name="Incorporated" minOccurs="0">
                <xs:complexType>
                  <xs:sequence>
                    <xs:element name="State" type="StateCodeType" />
                    <xs:element name="Date" type="xs:date" minOccurs="0" />
                  </xs:sequence>
                </xs:complexType>
              </xs:element>
              <xs:element name="SalesAmount" type="CurrencyType" minOccurs="0" />
              <xs:element name="NumberOfEmployees" minOccurs="0">
                <xs:simpleType>
                  <xs:restriction base="xs:integer">
                    <xs:totalDigits value="12" />
                  </xs:restriction>
                </xs:simpleType>
              </xs:element>
              <xs:element name="AssetsAmount" type="CurrencyType" minOccurs="0" />
              <xs:element name="NumberOfInsurancePolicies" minOccurs="0">
                <xs:simpleType>
                  <xs:restriction base="xs:integer">
                    <xs:totalDigits value="12" />
                  </xs:restriction>
                </xs:simpleType>
              </xs:element>
              <xs:element name="HolderID" minOccurs="0">
                <xs:simpleType>
                  <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                    <xs:pattern value="[0-9]{1,15}" />
                  </xs:restriction>
                </xs:simpleType>
              </xs:element>
              <xs:choice>
                <!-- Section 4.4.3 Report Element -->
                <xs:element name="Report">
                  <xs:complexType>
                    <xs:sequence>
                      <!-- Section 4.4.3.1 Report TypeCode Element Values -->
                      <xs:element name="TypeCode">
                        <xs:simpleType>
                          <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                            <xs:maxLength value="30" />
                            <xs:enumeration value="Advertisement/No Remittance" />
                            <xs:enumeration value="Remittance/Annual" />
                            <xs:enumeration value="Test" />
                            <xs:enumeration value="Audit" />
                            <xs:enumeration value="Supplemental/Correction" />
                            <xs:enumeration value="Reciprocal" />
                            <xs:enumeration value="Voluntary Disclosure Agreement" />
                            <xs:enumeration value="Final Remittance" />
                            <xs:enumeration value="Initial Remittance" />
                            <xs:enumeration value="Illicit Property" />
                          </xs:restriction>
                        </xs:simpleType>
                      </xs:element>
                      <xs:element name="AsOfDate" type="xs:date" />
                      <xs:element name="Contact" type="ContactType" maxOccurs="unbounded" />
                      <!-- Section 4.4.3.2 Property Element -->
                      <xs:element name="Property" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                        <xs:complexType>
                          <xs:sequence>
                            <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.1 Property TypeCode Element Values -->
                            <!-- See PropertyTypeCodeType (Section 7.3.3) for the full NAUPA II code list. -->
                            <xs:element name="TypeCode" type="PropertyTypeCodeType" />
                            <xs:element name="AccountNumber" minOccurs="0">
                              <xs:simpleType>
                                <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                  <xs:minLength value="1" />
                                  <xs:maxLength value="100" />
                                </xs:restriction>
                              </xs:simpleType>
                            </xs:element>
                            <xs:element name="PresumedAbandonedDate" type="xs:date" />
                            <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.2 DueDiligencePerformed Element -->
                            <xs:element name="DueDiligencePerformed" minOccurs="0">
                              <xs:complexType>
                                <xs:sequence>
                                  <xs:element name="Date1" type="xs:date" />
                                  <xs:element name="Date2" type="xs:date" minOccurs="0" />
                                </xs:sequence>
                              </xs:complexType>
                            </xs:element>
                            <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.3 ReturnedByPostOffice Element -->
                            <xs:element name="ReturnedByPostOffice" minOccurs="0">
                              <xs:complexType>
                                <xs:sequence>
                                  <xs:element name="MailDate" type="xs:date" />
                                  <!-- ReturnCount: mandatory, integer 0-99 -->
                                  <xs:element name="ReturnCount">
                                    <xs:simpleType>
                                      <xs:restriction base="xs:nonNegativeInteger">
                                        <xs:minInclusive value="0" />
                                        <xs:maxInclusive value="99" />
                                      </xs:restriction>
                                    </xs:simpleType>
                                  </xs:element>
                                  <xs:element name="DateAccountCodedRPO" type="xs:date" minOccurs="0" />
                                </xs:sequence>
                              </xs:complexType>
                            </xs:element>
                            <xs:element name="PayableOrDistributableDate" type="xs:date" minOccurs="0" />
                            <xs:choice>
                              <xs:element name="LastActivityDate" type="xs:date" />
                              <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.4 PeriodicPaymentDates Element -->
                              <xs:element name="PeriodicPaymentDates">
                                <xs:complexType>
                                  <xs:sequence>
                                    <xs:element name="StartDate" type="xs:date" />
                                    <xs:element name="EndDate" type="xs:date" />
                                  </xs:sequence>
                                </xs:complexType>
                              </xs:element>
                            </xs:choice>
                            <xs:element name="NonRemitIndicator" type="IndicatorType" minOccurs="0" />
                            <xs:element name="Taxable" type="IndicatorType" minOccurs="0" />
                            <xs:element name="TaxForm1099IssuedDate" type="xs:date" minOccurs="0" />
                            <xs:element name="DescriptionOrAdditionalInformation" minOccurs="0">
                              <xs:simpleType>
                                <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                  <xs:minLength value="1" />
                                  <xs:maxLength value="250" />
                                </xs:restriction>
                              </xs:simpleType>
                            </xs:element>
                            <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.5 AlternateLocation Element -->
                            <xs:element name="AlternateLocation" minOccurs="0">
                              <xs:complexType>
                                <xs:sequence>
                                  <xs:element name="Identifier" minOccurs="0">
                                    <xs:simpleType>
                                      <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                        <xs:minLength value="1" />
                                        <xs:maxLength value="20" />
                                      </xs:restriction>
                                    </xs:simpleType>
                                  </xs:element>
                                  <xs:choice>
                                    <xs:element name="USAddress" type="USAddressType" />
                                    <xs:element name="ForeignAddress" type="ForeignAddressType" />
                                  </xs:choice>
                                </xs:sequence>
                              </xs:complexType>
                            </xs:element>
                            <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.6 OFAC Element -->
                            <xs:element name="OFAC" minOccurs="0">
                              <xs:complexType>
                                <xs:sequence>
                                  <xs:element name="DateOfBlocking" type="xs:date" minOccurs="0" />
                                  <xs:element name="LegalAuthority">
                                    <xs:simpleType>
                                      <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                        <xs:minLength value="1" />
                                        <xs:maxLength value="100" />
                                      </xs:restriction>
                                    </xs:simpleType>
                                  </xs:element>
                                  <xs:element name="SanctionsTarget">
                                    <xs:simpleType>
                                      <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                        <xs:minLength value="1" />
                                        <xs:maxLength value="100" />
                                      </xs:restriction>
                                    </xs:simpleType>
                                  </xs:element>
                                  <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.6.1 OFAC OwnerType Element Values -->
                                  <xs:element name="OwnerType" minOccurs="0">
                                    <xs:simpleType>
                                      <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                        <xs:maxLength value="17" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="Individual" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="U.S. Bank" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="Non-U.S. Bank" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="U.S. Non-Bank" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="Non-U.S. Non-Bank" />
                                      </xs:restriction>
                                    </xs:simpleType>
                                  </xs:element>
                                </xs:sequence>
                              </xs:complexType>
                            </xs:element>
                            <xs:element name="HIPAAIndicator" type="IndicatorType" minOccurs="0" />
                            <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.7 Owner Element -->
                            <xs:element name="Owner" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                              <xs:complexType>
                                <xs:sequence>
                                  <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.7.1 Owner TypeCode Element Values -->
                                  <xs:element name="TypeCode">
                                    <xs:simpleType>
                                      <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                        <xs:maxLength value="3" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="AGG">
                                          <xs:annotation>
                                            <xs:documentation>Aggregate Property</xs:documentation>
                                          </xs:annotation>
                                        </xs:enumeration>
                                        <xs:enumeration value="UNK">
                                          <xs:annotation>
                                            <xs:documentation>Unknown</xs:documentation>
                                          </xs:annotation>
                                        </xs:enumeration>
                                        <xs:enumeration value="IND">
                                          <xs:annotation>
                                            <xs:documentation>All Individual Owners Except Aggregate and Unknown</xs:documentation>
                                          </xs:annotation>
                                        </xs:enumeration>
                                        <xs:enumeration value="BUS">
                                          <xs:annotation>
                                            <xs:documentation>All Non-Individual Owners Except Aggregate and Unknown</xs:documentation>
                                          </xs:annotation>
                                        </xs:enumeration>
                                      </xs:restriction>
                                    </xs:simpleType>
                                  </xs:element>
                                  <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.7.2 Identity Element -->
                                  <xs:element name="Identity" minOccurs="0">
                                    <xs:complexType>
                                      <xs:sequence>
                                        <xs:choice>
                                          <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.7.2.1 USTaxID Element -->
                                          <xs:element name="USTaxID">
                                            <xs:complexType>
                                              <xs:sequence>
                                                <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.7.2.1.1 USTaxID TypeCode Element Values -->
                                                <xs:element name="TypeCode">
                                                  <xs:simpleType>
                                                    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                                      <xs:maxLength value="4" />
                                                      <xs:enumeration value="SSN" />
                                                      <xs:enumeration value="FEIN" />
                                                      <xs:enumeration value="ITIN" />
                                                    </xs:restriction>
                                                  </xs:simpleType>
                                                </xs:element>
                                                <xs:element name="Number">
                                                  <xs:simpleType>
                                                    <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                                      <xs:pattern value="[0-9]{9}" />
                                                    </xs:restriction>
                                                  </xs:simpleType>
                                                </xs:element>
                                              </xs:sequence>
                                            </xs:complexType>
                                          </xs:element>
                                          <xs:element name="AlienID">
                                            <xs:simpleType>
                                              <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                                <xs:minLength value="1" />
                                                <xs:maxLength value="20" />
                                              </xs:restriction>
                                            </xs:simpleType>
                                          </xs:element>
                                        </xs:choice>
                                      </xs:sequence>
                                    </xs:complexType>
                                  </xs:element>
                                  <xs:element name="Contact" type="ContactType" />
                                  <xs:element name="Description" minOccurs="0">
                                    <xs:simpleType>
                                      <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                        <xs:minLength value="1" />
                                        <xs:maxLength value="255" />
                                      </xs:restriction>
                                    </xs:simpleType>
                                  </xs:element>
                                  <xs:element name="DateOfBirth" type="xs:date" minOccurs="0" />
                                  <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.7.3 RelationshipCode Element Values -->
                                  <xs:element name="RelationshipCode">
                                    <xs:simpleType>
                                      <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                        <xs:maxLength value="2" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="AD" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="AG" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="AF" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="AN" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="CP" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="CN" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="CF" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="DF" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="ES" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="EX" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="FB" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="GR" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="HE" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="IN" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="JT" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="TC" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="JE" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="PC" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="OR" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="OT" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="PD" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="PA" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="PO" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="RE" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="SO" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="TE" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="UG" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="UT" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="UN" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="UF" />
                                        <xs:enumeration value="LA" />
                                      </xs:restriction>
                                    </xs:simpleType>
                                  </xs:element>
                                  <!-- Section 4.4.3.2.7.2.2 DriversLicense Element -->
                                  <xs:element name="DriversLicense" minOccurs="0">
                                    <xs:complexType>
                                      <xs:sequence>
                                        <xs:element name="State" type="StateCodeType" />
                                        <xs:element name="Identifier">
                                          <xs:simpleType>
                                            <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                              <xs:minLength value="1" />
                                              <xs:maxLength value="20" />
                                            </xs:restriction>
                                          </xs:simpleType>
                                        </xs:element>
                                      </xs:sequence>
                                    </xs:complexType>
                                  </xs:element>
                                  <xs:element name="CompleteAccountRegistrationName" minOccurs="0">
                                    <xs:simpleType>
                                      <xs:restriction base="xs:string">
                                        <xs:minLength value="1" />
                                        <xs:maxLength value="255" />
                                      </xs:restriction>
                                    </xs:simpleType>
                                  </xs:element>
                                  <xs:element name="DateOfTrust" type="xs:date" minOccurs="0" />
